= Technology and Media Policy

Platforms, algorithms, and artificial intelligence are reshaping the economy and democratic discourse.

- @platform_rules: Regulate social media platforms
- @antitrust: Break up monopolies
- @ai_guardrails: AI safety and worker protections
- @easy_discard

@platform_rules
on-arrival: press_freedom += 1; polarization -= 1; pro_democracy += 1; biz_relation -= 3; abundance_dissent += 2; month_actions += 1

